  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to ICRC 2026-2028</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till ICRC 2026-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the International Committee of the Red Cross (ICRC) 2026-2028 is in line with Swedish development assistance goals and priorities, especially enhanced humanitarian assistance to save lives and alleviate suffering. The ICRC&apos;s activities include assisting victims of armed conflict, streamlining the delivery of humanitarian assistance in conflict situations, and promotion of international humanitarian law, humanitarian principles and its implementation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till den Internationella R&#xf6;dakorskommitt&#xe9;n (ICRC) 2026-2028 &#xe4;r i linje med svenska bist&#xe5;ndspolitiska m&#xe5;l och prioriteringar, s&#xe4;rskilt st&#xe4;rkt humanit&#xe4;rt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att r&#xe4;dda liv och lindra n&#xf6;d. ICRC genomf&#xf6;r insatser f&#xf6;r att bist&#xe5; offer i v&#xe4;pnade konflikter, effektivisera leveransen av humanit&#xe4;rt st&#xf6;d i konfliktsituationer, och fr&#xe4;mja internationell humanit&#xe4;r r&#xe4;tt, humanit&#xe4;ra principer och dess implementering.</narrative>
  </description>
